                                "target_word": "rejuvenating",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e1e4cf5-1164-3bdf-9f7b-a227ac359274",
                                        "entry_id": "c1aa5817-836c-337f-befd-96ec3a6d26b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a quality which rejuvenates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "111b27ba-da5c-4a08-84f1-fe66660c408d",
                                                "sense_id": "6e1e4cf5-1164-3bdf-9f7b-a227ac359274",
                                                "text": "Before coronavirus shuttered the world, a typical month for Connecticut native Zac Mathias was packed with appointments for microneedling (a collagen-stimulating process that involves repeated pin-pricks all over the face), regular resurfacing hydrafacials, rejuvenating laser treatments and the occasional red-light therapy session."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "492082af-1ff5-4e05-bba2-8baca3787854",
                                                "sense_id": "6e1e4cf5-1164-3bdf-9f7b-a227ac359274",
                                                "text": "The central concept of Kohn is “demosophy,” a sort of sociology, which is not only observing, but creative and rejuvenating."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5659bba7-a5c4-43b6-99fb-dbb877b0ba51",
                                                "sense_id": "6e1e4cf5-1164-3bdf-9f7b-a227ac359274",
                                                "text": "Nothing Like Six Months of Good Night's Sleeps As anyone of us can attest to, there is nothing like a good night's sleep. And if you are a bear, there is nothing so healing or rejuvenating as about six months of good night's sleeps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
